ds for each tip: little money, little time, little willpower and a large benefit come first. It takes at most two tips per topic and skips anything you have already done."]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"aria-labelledby":"checkup-steps-title"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{"id":"checkup-steps-title"},"children":["Three minutes from 677 tips to your 10"]},{"tag":"ol","props":{"className":"page-guide-steps"},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["0","1"]},{"tag":"h3","props":{},"children":["Answer 5 questions"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["All multiple choice, most allow several answers, and nothing personal is asked."]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["0","2"]},{"tag":"h3","props":{},"children":["See your top 10"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Each tip has a one-line summary and a link to the full text. Mark it done or add it to your to-dos right there."]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["0","3"]},{"tag":"h3","props":{},"children":["Add them all in one tap"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["They go into My list, where you can track progress or export them to your calendar, one a week."]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"page-guide-faq","aria-labelledby":"checkup-faq-title"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{"id":"checkup-faq-title"},"children":["Life checkup FAQ"]},{"tag":"details","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"summary","props":{},"children":["Do I need an account or to pay?"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["No. The checkup, the results and adding to-dos all work without signing in, and your list is stored in this browser. Sign in to sync it across devices."]}]},{"tag":"details","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"summary","props":{},"children":["Are my answers uploaded?"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["No. They stay in this browser so your last result can be shown next time. Shared links do not include your answers either."]}]},{"tag":"details","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"summary","props":{},"children":["How is the result worked out?"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Each answer raises the weight of related topics. Tips are then scored using the benefit, money, time and willpower the book records, plus the book's own order within each topic. It is a transparent rule, not personalized medical, legal or financial advice."]}]},{"tag":"details","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"summary","props":{},"children":["Why do some tips not fit me?"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Five questions cannot cover every situation. Skip what does not fit, or keep browsing the book by topic and evidence grade."]}]},{"tag":"details","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"summary","props":{},"children":["How often should I take it?"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Retake it when your life changes: a new job, a move, a new baby. Tips you have done are skipped, so you get the next batch worth doing."]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tabbar","aria-label":"Main navigation"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/en/book"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-book-open","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 7v14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Book"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/en/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin